<model>
    <name>toaster_4_slice</name>
    <version>1.0</version>
    <sdf version="1.6">model.sdf</sdf>
    <author>
        <name>Ilia O.</name>
        <email>iliao@kaia.ai</email>
    </author>
    <description>Four-slice toaster, 0.288 x 0.230 x 0.185 m, authored from primitives. Replaces the Google Scanned Objects scan, which cost 47,628 triangles and 4.4 MB for an object that is a few hundred pixels across on camera; decimating that scan destroys its UVs, so it was rebuilt instead. Brushed stainless body with two long slots, a carriage lever and a browning dial.</description>
</model>
